{"sections":[],"kind":"article","metadata":{"title":"Getting Started","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Essentials","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/AddMarkerSymbolExample"],"anchor":"Essentials"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Setting up an Xcode project that uses MapLibre Native for iOS.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Create-a-new-iOS-project","text":"Create a new iOS project","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Create a new (SwiftUI) iOS project with Xcode. Go to ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"File > New > Project…"}]},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Add-MapLibre-Native-as-a-dependency","text":"Add MapLibre Native as a dependency","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"MapLibre Native for iOS is available on ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/cocoapods.org","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" and on the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/swiftpackageindex.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-gl-native-distribution","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" (for use with the Swift Package Manager). However, for this guide we will add the MapLibre Native as a package dependency directly.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In Xcode, right click your project and select “Add Package Dependencies…”:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"AddPackageDependencies.png","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Paste the following URL and click Add Package:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing","code":["https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-gl-native-distribution"]},{"name":"Note","style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-gl-native-distribution","type":"reference"},{"text":" repository only exists for distributing the iOS package of MapLibre Native. To report issues and ask questions, use the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-native","type":"reference"},{"text":" repository.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Verify you can import MapLibre in your app:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import MapLibre"]},{"text":"SwiftUI","level":2,"anchor":"SwiftUI","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To use MapLibre with SwiftUI we need to create a wrapper for the UIKit view that MapLibre provides (using UIViewRepresentable. The simplest way to implement this protocol is as follows:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["struct SimpleMap: UIViewRepresentable {","    func makeUIView(context _: Context) -> MLNMapView {","        let mapView = MLNMapView()","        return mapView","    }","","    func updateUIView(_: MLNMapView, context _: Context) {}","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You can use this view directly in a SwiftUI View hierarchy, for example:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["struct MyApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup {","            SimpleMap().edgesIgnoringSafeArea(.all)","        }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When running your app in the simulator you should be greeted with the default "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/demotiles.maplibre.org\/"},{"text":" style:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"DemotilesScreenshot.png"}]},{"text":"UIKit","level":2,"anchor":"UIKit","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You can use the following ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UIViewController"},{"text":" to get started with MapLibre Native iOS with UIKit.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["class SimpleMap: UIViewController, MLNMapViewDelegate {","    var mapView: MLNMapView!","","    override func viewDidLoad() {","        super.viewDidLoad()","","        mapView = MLNMapView(frame: view.bounds)","        mapView.autoresizingMask = [.flexibleWidth, .flexibleHeight]","        view.addSubview(mapView)","","        mapView.delegate = self","    }","","    \/\/ MLNMapViewDelegate method called when map has finished loading","    func mapView(_: MLNMapView, didFinishLoading _: MLNStyle) {","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/GettingStarted"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/gettingstarted"]}],"references":{"DemotilesScreenshot.png":{"alt":null,"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/org.swift.MyProject\/DemotilesScreenshot@2x.png","traits":["2x","light"]}],"type":"image","identifier":"DemotilesScreenshot.png"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"abstract":[{"text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","kind":"symbol","title":"MapLibre"},"https://github.com/maplibre/maplibre-native":{"title":"maplibre-native","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"maplibre-native"}],"type":"link","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-native","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-native"},"https://cocoapod